				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13797057/can-you-show-me-the-way-to-alagadda#post-4791575</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2020 13:53:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ManyMeats</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2104082</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There's a lot of care and effort put into this and the final product reflects that.</p> <blockquote> <p>Whatever happens now is all up to me. An impenitent thief.</p> </blockquote> <p>This was a great section/passage for how you encirlced this work and tied it all off within itself.</p> <p>I'll be honest, this is a <em>small</em> push forward in the concept/canon for me (although it may not be for those that know more about it) but in a way that's its charm. It feels rounded. You're not trying to blow my mind with a grandiose cosmically horrific word-based phantasmagoria but there are definitely elements of some surrealism.</p> <p>This is measured, and better for it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
